# agent-voice-input credential environment template
# Default location: ~/.config/agent-voice-input/agent-voice-input.env (chmod 600 recommended)
# Also falls back to ~/.config/voice-input/voice-input.env or process environment variables
# Naming rule: canonical vendor name preferred (<VENDOR>_API_KEY); prefix aliases (API_KEY_<VENDOR>) also supported
# Tip: in your real .env file, keep only the credentials you actually use and remove/comment out unused placeholders.

# === Stage 1: Speech Recognition (REQUIRED for cloud ASR — configure at least one; local loopback openai-compatible ASR needs no key) ===
# (DashScope, OpenAI, DeepSeek, Groq, OpenRouter, Gemini, and SiliconFlow also work for Stage 2 refinement)

# 1. Alibaba Cloud Bailian / DashScope (provider = "dashscope", default auto Stage 1: qwen3-asr-flash or single-hop qwen3.8-omni-flash; Stage 2: qwen3.8-flash)
# DASHSCOPE_API_KEY="<your-dashscope-api-key>"
# Supported aliases: ALI_API_KEY / API_KEY_ALI

# 2. OpenAI (provider = "openai" or "openai-compatible", Stage 1: gpt-transcribe or single-hop gpt-audio-1.5/gpt-audio-mini; Stage 2: gpt-6-luna)
# OPENAI_API_KEY="<your-openai-api-key>"
# Supported alias: API_KEY_OPENAI

# 3. DeepSeek Official API (provider = "deepseek", single key for Stage 1 ASR: deepseek-asr & Stage 2 Refiner: deepseek-flash)
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY="<your-deepseek-api-key>"
# Supported alias: API_KEY_DEEPSEEK

# 4. Groq Cloud (provider = "groq", fast Stage 1 Whisper STT & Stage 2 Refiner)
# GROQ_API_KEY="<your-groq-api-key>"
# Supported alias: API_KEY_GROQ

# 5. OpenRouter (provider = "openrouter", supports both Stage 1 dual-protocol ASR & Stage 2 Refiner with one key)
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY="<your-openrouter-api-key>"
# Supported alias: API_KEY_OPENROUTER

# 6. Google Gemini (provider = "gemini", native single-hop Stage 1 ASR or Stage 2 Refiner)
# GEMINI_API_KEY="<your-gemini-api-key>"
# Supported alias: API_KEY_GEMINI

# 7. Volcengine Doubao Speech (provider = "doubao", Stage 1 ASR: bigmodel; single-header X-Api-Key, no APP_ID needed)
# DOUBAO_SPEECH_API_KEY="<your-volcengine-speech-api-key>"
# Legacy dual-header app credentials (optional; still supported when DOUBAO_SPEECH_API_KEY is unset):
# DOUBAO_ASR_APP_ID="<your-volcengine-speech-app-id>"
# DOUBAO_ASR_API_KEY="<your-volcengine-speech-access-token>"
# Legacy prefix aliases: APP_ID_DOUBAO_ASR / API_KEY_DOUBAO_ASR

# 8. SiliconFlow (provider = "siliconflow", Stage 1 SenseVoiceSmall STT & Stage 2 Refiner)
# SILICONFLOW_API_KEY="<your-siliconflow-api-key>"
# Supported alias: API_KEY_SILICONFLOW

# === Stage 2 Only: Optional Refiner (pair with a Stage 1 key above) ===
# Note: Setting ONLY a Stage 2 key below cannot transcribe speech on its own.
# Local Codex CLI login (`codex login`, auto-detected) or Antigravity CLI (`refiner.provider = "agy"`)
# can also reuse your existing CLI login for Stage 2 refinement when paired with Stage 1 ASR
# (billing depends on your CLI auth mode, e.g., subscription login vs. API key).

# 9. Volcengine Ark (provider = "volcengine", Stage 2 Refiner: doubao-seed-2-0-mini-260428)
# ARK_API_KEY="<your-volcengine-ark-api-key>"
# Supported aliases: VOLCENGINE_API_KEY / HUOSHAN_API_KEY / API_KEY_HUOSHAN

# Non-secret options (providers, models, hotkeys, HUD, audio, retries, etc.) belong in ~/.config/agent-voice-input/config.toml.
